{"path":"js/packages/host-companion/README.md","ref":"c0498393dd5911d602c63433160a3a7fa020e308","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":1,"text":"# VitaDeck Host Companion"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":3,"text":"The Host Companion runs on a Mac, Windows or Linux computer near your Vita. A Deck App sends it **Host Control** commands over the LAN, and the companion runs them on the computer. It needs Node.js 24."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":5,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":6,"text":"npm install -g @vitadeck/host-companion"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":7,"text":"```"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":8,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":9,"text":"It is not published to npm yet. From a VitaDeck checkout, `pnpm --dir js host-companion <command>` runs the same CLI."},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":10,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":11,"text":"**Security:** v1 trusts the LAN. There are no credentials: a link exchanges addresses and authorizes nothing, and IP checks can be spoofed. That is why the built-in plugins only read information. Plugins that act on the computer (keys, launching apps) wait for the credential decision in [ADR 0004](../../../docs/adr/0004-host-control-sliced-delivery.md)."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":12,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":13,"text":"## Use"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":14,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":15,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":16,"text":"vitadeck-host-companion start"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":17,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":18,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":19,"text":"Serves `POST /command` on every interface, port 8797. The port never moves to a free one, because the Vita stores the URL; if it is busy, `start` exits with an error. It prints its URLs, the loaded plugins, and one line per request (time, peer, `plugin.command`, result, duration). Payloads are never logged."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":20,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":21,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":22,"text":"vitadeck-host-companion link 192.168.1.177"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":23,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":24,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":25,"text":"Open Host Control in the VitaDeck Shell and pass the address it shows (add `:port` if it is not 8798). `link` checks that `start` is answering, then tells VitaDeck where to send commands. One Vita can link several computers, and one computer can link several Vitas."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":26,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":27,"text":"Options: `--port N` (`start` and `link`; use the same one for both), `--plugin <file.vdplugin>` (repeatable, `start` only), `--advertise <ip>` (`link` only), `--config <path>`."},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":28,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":29,"text":"## Plugins"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":30,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":31,"text":"Every companion has the built-in plugins: `core` (`capabilities`, `echo`) and `systemStats` (`read`: CPU, memory, uptime). A Deck App imports their registries from `@vitadeck/sdk/host-control`."},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":32,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":33,"text":"A Deck App that needs more brings its own plugin as a **Host Plugin File** (`.vdplugin`), which its author ships next to the `.vdapp.zip`:"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":34,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":35,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":36,"text":"vitadeck-host-companion install lights.vdplugin"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":37,"text":"vitadeck-host-companion remove lights"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":38,"text":"```"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":39,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":40,"text":"`install` copies the file to `~/.vitadeck/plugins/`, named by the plugin's id, and a running companion loads it at once. A plugin runs with your permissions on this computer, so install only plugins you trust."},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":41,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":42,"text":"To write one, scaffold a Deck App with `npx @vitadeck/sdk create my-app --host-plugin`; the [SDK README](../sdk/README.md#host-control) explains the files. While you work on it, `start --plugin ./dist/my-app.vdplugin` loads your build, takes precedence over an installed copy, and reloads every time `vitadeck build` or `vitadeck dev` writes it. A broken build keeps the previous version running."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":43,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":44,"text":"## Config"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":45,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":46,"text":"`~/.vitadeck/host-companion.json`, created on first use:"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":47,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":48,"text":"- `id`: generated once. VitaDeck keeps one link per id, so relinking replaces the old link."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":49,"text":"- `name`: shown on the Vita. Defaults to the hostname."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":50,"text":"- `port`: 8797."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":51,"text":"- `advertise`: the IP put in the link URL. `null` uses the interface your computer routes to the Vita, which skips VPN and Docker interfaces."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":52,"text":"- `vitas`: Vita IPs that `link` added. While it is empty, the companion answers everyone; once it is not, only those Vitas, loopback and this computer's own addresses get answers, and everyone else gets `forbidden`."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":53,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":54,"text":"Installed plugins live in `plugins/` next to the config file, so `--config` gives a second companion its own plugins too."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":55,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":56,"text":"## Run in the background"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":57,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":58,"text":"The companion has no tray icon; let the OS start it at login."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":59,"text":""},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":60,"text":"**macOS:** save as `~/Library/LaunchAgents/dev.vitadeck.host-companion.plist`, then `launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/dev.vitadeck.host-companion.plist`. The login shell finds `vitadeck-host-companion` the same way your terminal does."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":61,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":62,"text":"```xml"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":63,"text":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":64,"text":"<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC \"-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN\" \"http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd\">"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":65,"text":"<plist version=\"1.0\">"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":66,"text":"<dict>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":67,"text":"  <key>Label</key><string>dev.vitadeck.host-companion</string>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":68,"text":"  <key>ProgramArguments</key>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":69,"text":"  <array>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":70,"text":"    <string>/bin/zsh</string><string>-lc</string>"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":71,"text":"    <string>vitadeck-host-companion start</string>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":72,"text":"  </array>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":73,"text":"  <key>RunAtLoad</key><true/>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":74,"text":"  <key>KeepAlive</key><true/>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":75,"text":"  <key>StandardOutPath</key><string>/tmp/vitadeck-host-companion.log</string>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":76,"text":"  <key>StandardErrorPath</key><string>/tmp/vitadeck-host-companion.log</string>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":77,"text":"</dict>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":78,"text":"</plist>"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":79,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":80,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":81,"text":"**Windows:** create a scheduled task that starts at log on:"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":82,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":83,"text":"```bat"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":84,"text":"schtasks /Create /SC ONLOGON /TN \"VitaDeck Host Companion\" /TR \"cmd /c vitadeck-host-companion start\""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":85,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":86,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":87,"text":"**Linux:** save as `~/.config/systemd/user/vitadeck-host-companion.service`, then `systemctl --user enable --now vitadeck-host-companion`."},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":88,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":89,"text":"```ini"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":90,"text":"[Unit]"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":91,"text":"Description=VitaDeck Host Companion"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":92,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":93,"text":"[Service]"},{"sha":"148fceefdc9d0272fa9341bb6c5c119611ee9d75","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793249238,"line":94,"text":"ExecStart=/bin/bash -lc \"vitadeck-host-companion start\""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":95,"text":"Restart=on-failure"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":96,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":97,"text":"[Install]"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":98,"text":"WantedBy=default.target"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":99,"text":"```"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":100,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":101,"text":"## Firewall"},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":102,"text":""},{"sha":"9c60f8a2ea9631168bc0352f946cd525c28c0b47","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1793225921,"line":103,"text":"The Vita connects to the companion, so the computer must accept incoming connections on the port. The first `start` triggers a prompt: on macOS, allow `node` to accept incoming network connections; on Windows, allow Node.js on private networks. On Linux, open the port in your firewall if one is running (`sudo ufw allow 8797/tcp`)."}]}
